Package: tennisCareer
Title: Retrieve and Visualize Tennis Career Matches
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jingwei", "Chen", email = "jingwei.chen.berkeley@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Retrieve tennis career match records from Tennis Abstract,
    calculate player and opponent ages, and visualize age differences
    by match outcome.
